{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Golden Pumpkin is an item that can be obtained every other year during the ",["l","万灵节","Spirit's Eve"]," ",["l","节日","Festival"]," by ",["l","万灵节","completing the maze"],". It can also be found in ",["l","古物宝藏","Artifact Trove"],"s (3.7% chance), ",["l","谜之盒","Mystery Box"],"es, and ",["l","金色谜之盒","Golden Mystery Box"],"es."]],["p",["It can be sold through the ",["l","售卖","Shipping Bin"]," for 2,500g. Despite its description, it has two other uses:"]],["l",0,[[1,["It can be gifted as a ",["l","友谊","universally loved gift"],"."]],[1,["It can be ",["l","裁缝","tailored"]," into a ",["l","女巫帽","Witch Hat"]," at the ",["l","柳巷2号","sewing machine at Emily's house"]," or the ",["l","缝纫机","sewing machine"]," gifted by ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],"."]]]]]],["Gifting",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Love"]},[["l","罗宾","Robin"],", ",["l","德米特里厄斯","Demetrius"],", ",["l","玛鲁","Maru"],", ",["l","塞巴斯蒂安","Sebastian"],", ",["l","莱纳斯","Linus"],", ",["l","皮埃尔","Pierre"],", ",["l","卡洛琳","Caroline"],", ",["l","阿比盖尔","Abigail"],", ",["l","亚历克斯","Alex"],", ",["l","乔治","George"],", ",["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"],", ",["l","刘易斯","Lewis"],", ",["l","克林特","Clint"],", ",["l","潘妮","Penny"],", ",["l","潘姆","Pam"],", ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],", ",["l","海莉","Haley"],", ",["l","贾斯","Jas"],", ",["l","文森特","Vincent"],", ",["l","乔迪","Jodi"],", ",["l","肯特","Kent"],", ",["l","山姆","Sam"],", ",["l","莉亚","Leah"],", ",["l","谢恩","Shane"],", ",["l","玛妮","Marnie"],", ",["l","艾利欧特","Elliott"],", ",["l","格斯","Gus"],", ",["l","矮人","Dwarf"],", ",["l","法师","Wizard"],", ",["l","哈维","Harvey"],", ",["l","桑迪","Sandy"],", ",["l","威利","Willy"],", ",["l","科罗布斯","Krobus"],", ",["l","雷欧","Leo"]]]]]]],["Bundles",2,[["p",["The Golden Pumpkin is not used in any ",["l","收集包","bundles"],"."]]]],["Tailoring",2,[["p",["A Golden Pumpkin is used in the spool of the ",["l","柳巷2号","Sewing Machine"]," to create the ",["i","(H)70","Witch Hat"],". It can be used in ",["l","染色","dyeing"],", serving as a yellow dye at the dye pots, located 